<p class="muted">The "Today at Mystic" panel (current conditions and the hourly forecast for today) uses <a href="{{ links.openmeteo }}">Open-Meteo.com</a> model data
(CC BY 4.0). Forecast data: NOAA GFS.</p>
<p class="muted">{% if uses_ausrasp %}Thermal height and updraft are <a href="{{ links.ausrasp }}">AUSRASP</a>'s forecast for {{ ausrasp_area }} ({{ ausrasp_runs|join(", ") }}).{% else %}Thermal height, quality and updraft are estimated from the global model, calibrated against <a href="{{ links.ausrasp }}">AUSRASP</a> forecasts.{% endif %} AUSRASP's
<a href="{{ links.ausrasp_vic }}">Victoria forecast</a> is supported by the
